{
  "id": "07-claude-dashboards",
  "title": "Claude dashboards: connect, ask, inspect",
  "duration": 42.4107,
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Claude Dashboards can connect to Databricks and build a dashboard from a question.",
      "asset": "claude-source",
      "device": "tile",
      "key": "Claude Dashboards",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.3413,
      "voice_end": 4.1813
    },
    {
      "text": "Anthropic announced it on October eighth. The announcement describes a beta on paid plans.",
      "asset": "claude-source",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 4.3413,
      "end": 9.5147,
      "voice_end": 9.3547
    },
    {
      "text": "Step one. Connect a supported data platform, such as Databricks, Snowflake or Big Query.",
      "asset": "claude-connect",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 9.5147,
      "end": 15.0293,
      "voice_end": 14.8693
    },
    {
      "text": "Step two. Ask a specific question in plain English, like this week's signups compared with last month's.",
      "asset": "claude-question",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 15.0293,
      "end": 21.2053,
      "voice_end": 21.0453
    },
    {
      "text": "Claude retrieves the data and builds the dashboard. This is a source based walkthrough of the announced feature.",
      "asset": "claude-source",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 21.2053,
      "end": 27.3173,
      "voice_end": 27.1573
    },
    {
      "text": "Step three. Inspect the answer. The announcement says you can click a number to see its query.",
      "asset": "claude-query",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 27.3173,
      "end": 32.4907,
      "voice_end": 32.3307
    },
    {
      "text": "Each chart also shows when its data was last refreshed.",
      "asset": "claude-query",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 32.4907,
      "end": 35.8933,
      "voice_end": 35.7333
    },
    {
      "text": "Enterprise admins must enable the feature. Check access and verify the query before sharing the result.",
      "asset": "claude-source",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 35.8933,
      "end": 42.4107,
      "voice_end": 42.2507
    }
  ],
